# Normalize line endings: text files are stored with LF in git (workers' editors write a mix of
# CRLF and LF). Godot reads either. See docs/team/code-quality.md.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.glb binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.exr binary
*.res binary
*.scn binary
